      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-26T20:14:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That certainly doesn\u0027t hurt, but I thought this would be automatically initialized to false? (See https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/zero_initialization.)",
      "parentUuid": "eb367b1a_8d4981a0",
